# The armory's Vanity screen. Keys are relative to Mods.Levy.Vanity.

Tab: Vanity
TabHint: Vanity sets for the levies. A set changes how they look, never what they can do.
AddSet: + New set
AddSetHint: Adds a row with head, body and legs vanity and who wears it.
Note: "For each slot the most specific row wins: named levies, then a class, then everyone."
Empty: No vanity sets yet. Add one to dress your levies.
SetTitle: "Set {0}"
OnHint: Turns this set on or off.
TargetHint: Who wears this set.
TargetAll: All levies
TargetClass: A class
TargetLevies: "Levies: {0}"
TargetLeviesPlain: Chosen levies
ClassHint: The class that wears this set.
ChooseLevies: Choose levies...
LeviesHint: Picks the levies who wear this set.
RemoveHint: Removes this set. The items go with it.
UpHint: Moves this set up.
DownHint: Moves this set down.
Slot_Head: Head
Slot_Body: Body
Slot_Legs: Legs
Slot_DyeHead: Dye
Slot_DyeBody: Dye
Slot_DyeLegs: Dye
SlotHint_Head: Head vanity
SlotHint_Body: Body vanity
SlotHint_Legs: Legs vanity
SlotHint_DyeHead: Head dye
SlotHint_DyeBody: Body dye
SlotHint_DyeLegs: Legs dye
NothingYet: Nothing set.
WornByAll: Worn by all levies.
WornByClass: "Worn by {0}."
WornByLevies: "Worn by {0} chosen levies."
NoLevies: No levies served here.
